{"id":13142,"chapter_id":13,"scene_id":1318,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"唐","content":"……我们是上个时代的遗民。","voice":["vo_cgplot_13142020"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1314","style":1,"background":10003,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"唐","content":"我们的时代不鄙薄弱者，冷酷也不是什么酷事儿。那个年代不嘲笑理想，我可以堂堂正正地说，我做的一切都是因为爱。","voice":["vo_cgplot_13142011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1314","style":1,"background":10003,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"唐","content":"爱朋友，爱理想，爱身边努力活着的每一个人，爱这个辛迪加，爱所有覆灭的美好和还没到来的可能性。","voice":["vo_cgplot_13142012"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1314","style":1,"background":10003,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"唐","content":"时代总会前行，也许属于我们的时代已经过去，新的时代历经残酷，更相信力量和利益。","voice":["vo_cgplot_13142013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1314","style":1,"background":10003,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"唐","content":"但这个时代也终会成为过去，下一个时代会是什么样呢？一定是由那些正在战斗的人书写了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_13142014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1314","style":1,"background":10003,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"唐","content":"真期待啊……","voice":["vo_cgplot_13142015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_1314","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}